.
.  Create a GIF file for a 4-plot plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
TITLE SIZE 4
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
LABEL CASE ASIS
X3LABEL AUTOMATIC
LABEL SIZE 4
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
X3LABEL DISPLACEMENT 12
THICKNESS 0.2
.
SKIP 25
READ LEW.DAT Y
.
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 00
MULTIPLOT SCALE FACTOR 2
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
4-PLOT Y
.
justification center
height 4
move 50 96
text 4-plot
.
LET STRING MARK = LEW.DAT
MOVE 99 1
JUST RIGHT
HEIGHT 3
TEXT ^MARK
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
system mv dppl1f.dat 4-plot.ps
QUIT
